{%- comment -%}
  "Results" testimonial cards (copy of the goda.co block): one card at a time with a picture on top, a big percentage that COUNTS UP, a short line about it, the customer's quote and "Name | Verified Customer", and little dots underneath to move between the cards.
  The percentage counts up exactly like the original script: the first card counts once when the page loads, every number counts again when the cards are half on screen, and the new card counts every time a card slides in. The row loops round forever (swipe past the last card and you are back at the first).
  No slider app and no slider library, just the browser's own scrolling, so it loads fast. Pictures load only when they get near the screen.
  WHERE: Online Store > Themes > Customize > Product page > Add block (or Add section) > Custom Liquid, drag it where you want it (for example under your accordions in the product column), paste this in. The card fills the width it is given, up to mb_max_w.
  EDIT YOUR CONTENT BELOW. Do not use a straight apostrophe (') in the text, use &#39; instead, and write & as &amp;
  !!! THE THREE CARDS BELOW (REVIEWS, PERCENTAGES AND PICTURES) ARE THE ORIGINAL ONES FROM goda.co. THEY ARE ONLY HERE SO YOU CAN SEE THE SECTION WORKING. Do NOT publish another brand's customers, reviews or results on your own store. Replace every card with REAL reviews from YOUR customers (with their permission), upload your own pictures in Shopify admin > Content > Files, and only use percentages that come from your own real customer survey or testing.
  mb_cards = the cards, separated by @@ , and each card written as   PICTURE LINK ||| NUMBER ||| LINE UNDER THE NUMBER ||| THE QUOTE ||| NAME
  Example of one card:   https://yourstore.com/file.jpg ||| 91 ||| Said their skin felt softer ||| &ldquo;Love it!&rdquo; ||| Anna K.     (write 91 for 91%; leave the NUMBER empty to show no percentage; add as many cards as you like).
  mb_verified = the words after the name (for example Verified Customer). Leave empty to show only the name.
  mb_ratio = the shape of the card pictures as width / height (1 / 1 = square, 4 / 5 = a little taller, 16 / 9 = wide). Write auto to show every picture at its own natural shape, uncropped.
  mb_radius = how round the card corners are. mb_pad = the space inside the text part of the card (top left-right bottom, for example 18px 18px 20px).
  mb_num_size = the size of the big percentage. mb_text_size = the size of the line under it, the quote and the name.
  mb_max_w = the widest the card gets (use none to always fill the space it sits in).
  mb_color_text = the line under the number, the quote and the name. mb_color_num = the big percentage. mb_color_check = the little tick next to the name. mb_color_accent = the dots. mb_card_bg / mb_card_border = card colour / its outline.
  mb_top / mb_bottom = space above and below the block.
{%- endcomment -%}
